WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope everybody's doing well.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.571
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:09.041
Hunter Biden spoke outside
the US Capitol yesterday

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.443
and criticized Republicans

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.245
for ridiculing
his struggle with addiction.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.980
Unfortunately, when it
comes to Hunter Biden,

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.684
Republicans are also
struggling with addiction.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.652
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:22.055
That's right. Hunter Biden
spoke to reporters yesterday

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.590
and said that his father was

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.458
"not financially involved in
any of his business ventures."

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:27.927
Well, I believe that.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.261
He seems like the kind of dad

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:31.564
who wouldn't even get involved
in your lemonade stand

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.099
when you were a kid.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.634
[ As Biden ] "You want
to sell lemonade, do you?

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.670
I guess you'd better get busy
planting a lemon tree."

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.006
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:43.242
At a rally last night in Iowa,
former President Trump said

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:46.079
that he feels mentally sharper
now than he was 20 years ago,

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.814
and added he is
a "much better golfer

00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:50.483
than he was 10
or 15 years ago."

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.919
Well, that's what four years
of uninterrupted practice

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:56.856
will do for you.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.191
A new poll now shows
former President Trump

00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:01.760
leading President Biden
in all seven swing states

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.496
that will decide
the 2024 election.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.097
Which brings us
to our new segment,

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:07.333
"Seth Tries to Remember
Where He Put His Passport."

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.803 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:11.871
Is it my desk drawer?

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.005
No, I took it out of my
desk drawer

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:13.840
'cause of the kids.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.041
Maybe in my bag?

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:18.311
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.745
Damn it. You know what?
I'm just going to...

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:23.082
"Call Alexi after show."

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:25.617
[ Laughter ]
-This has been...

00:01:25.617 --> 00:01:28.287
"Seth Tries to Remember
Where He Put His Passport."

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:29.756
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.791
-Russian President
Vladimir Putin

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.193
held his annual end-of-year
news conference today

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.228
and answered questions
for more than four hours --

00:01:36.228 --> 00:01:38.931
important questions such as
"why are you so handsome"

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:41.067
and "please be
our president forever?"

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.136
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.138
Today was former
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy's

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:46.973
last day at the Capitol
before he resigns

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:48.574
at the end of the year
from Congress.

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:51.344
There was a going away party
for him, but he wasn't invited.

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:54.613
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.249
Boston Mayor Michelle Wu
is facing criticism

00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:58.951
for holding a holiday party
specifically

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:00.653
for nonwhite members
of city council.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:04.290
Said Wu, "Sorry if for once
I wanted the food to be good."

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.659
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:10.864
According to the latest numbers,

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:12.699
North Dakota has
the lowest divorce rate

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:14.534
in the country
at less than 1%,

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.136
which is ironic since it's one
of the only states

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.272
that's legally separated
from its partner.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.609
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.876
Map comedy.

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:26.279
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.380
A family aboard their houseboat
in Florida

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.950
recently found a snake that
was hiding in a sock drawer.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.553
Though, honestly,
on a houseboat in Florida,

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:36.122
I would have been more surprised
if they had found socks.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.391
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.263
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:45.464
I love that joke so much.

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:46.866
True story --
Did it yesterday,

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.836
stumbled on it a little bit.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:52.070
Said to Baze, I said, "You know
what, Baze? Let's cut it.

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.741
Let's put it in tomorrow,
get the home run it deserves."

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.743
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.345
Said it perfectly,
exact same result.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:02.782
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.850
And finally, Apple is reportedly

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.120
planning to overhaul
its lineup of iPads

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.756
to make it
"less confusing for consumers."

00:03:09.756 --> 00:03:11.424
In the meantime,
owners of an iPad

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:13.993
are being asked to direct
any tech questions they may have

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.329
to the nearest toddler.
[ Chuckles ]

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:18.164
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:20.400
We're off.
We're off and running.

